          "content": "<article class=\"dbzf-rulebook dbzf-gm-guide\"><p>This guide is the working GM guide/Cheat Sheet for setting up sheets, reading the math, and handling common warnings in the calibrated Foundry system.</p><p>Use it as a practical reference while building characters, species, techniques, equipment, boosts, and test worlds.</p></article>"
